# Raw BLE notification payloads captured from a physical WitMotion WTVB01-BT50
# (MAC E6:6B:9A:CC:88:25, firmware VersionNumber 10057.2.7, return rate 100 Hz) through
# the official WitMotion Android app (HCI snoop log), on 2026-10-04. The sensor was being
# moved by hand. One hex-encoded BLE notification per line; each notification carries
# several concatenated sensor packets (ATT MTU was negotiated high by the phone).
# Mode: Now data (0x61, 40-byte packets with chip time + acceleration, 4 per notification).
















































































